Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:24.41,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可别小看人类
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:26.46,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,别说废话了 快开始游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:33.18,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,难得有如此愉悦的时刻 真是性急的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:54.28,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这个是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:00:59.56,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那个时候的…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.93,0:01:05.88,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,预选赛的那个可以说是体验版
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:09.59,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,也就是说这次的才是完全版
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:14.93,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真正的Super Rumble Land  其最终关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.07,0:01:22.48,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,请尽情享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:25.80,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,其名为 拉莱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:02:58.24,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:02:59.99,Default,Commentator,0,0,0,,Super Rumble Land
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:04.50,DefaultTop,Announcer,0,0,0,,应该是Megalox公司正在制作中的网络游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:07.33,DefaultTop,Commentator,0,0,0,,没想到会以这种形式公开在大众眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.61,0:03:09.36,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,为黒廼灵子加油打气的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.70,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,已经占满了互联网的每条管道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:14.06,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,请大家带上标签 #加油灵子
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.54,0:03:18.01,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真是热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:22.81,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,为你加油的话语正从全世界汇集过来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.68,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,真是疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.68,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这次是这种模式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:32.27,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,被逼上绝路的人 总是会出乎我的意料
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:35.16,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,虽然以前我已经见过不少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:39.13,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这样就能凑够你们一直想要的那个复活点数吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:40.61,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,哎呀 你就等着看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:45.87,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,等到一切结束的那一瞬间 就会砰地一下爆出一大堆点数
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:47.83,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,就是这种机制啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:51.54,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,反正和我又没什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:57.63,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,你就是这种地方才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:01.14,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,吵死人了 赶紧闭嘴开始游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.99,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,如果我赢了 就要让你把舞由的身体还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.37,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:07.68,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,只要你做得到就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.65,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.40,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:18.96,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余会在终点等着你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:21.20,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,就在那里决一胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:31.16,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那么 黒廼灵子选手 无论如何这都是最后的回合了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:33.47,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:34.75,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,放马过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.17,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,好了对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:37.79,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那就预备
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.31,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,人类和邪神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:42.71,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,两者处于绝对无法互相理解的悲伤关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.31,0:04:47.93,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那长久的战争即将在此终结
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.89,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,如果灵子选手胜利的话 我们将会撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:56.18,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,可如果她失败的话 我们将会使用存储至今的复活点数
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.86,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,使我们在现实世界显现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:01.86,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,于是 在赌上世界命运的这个时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:05.35,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,游戏开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:09.98,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,剩下的时间还剩15分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:15.21,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,灵子选手能到达终点并且打败等候在那的克苏鲁大王吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.59,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这就是最后的试炼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:21.91,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,登上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:27.76,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,如果真有那所谓的人类的尊严的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:31.35,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那就尽管展现给余看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:39.93,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:44.29,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,不是用玩偶的身体 感觉完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:53.22,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,毕竟这次是单人游戏 不用担心什么演算或者延迟问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.56,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,可以把真实的灵子完整地展现出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:58.61,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,混账 尽在这种奇怪的地方搞优化
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:00.13,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,毕竟是正式版
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.25,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这可真是出色
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:17.88,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,为她的执念鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:21.26,DefaultTop,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,给予奖励点数
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.96,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,小灵子 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:26.04,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,地球的未来就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.03,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,失败了的话要你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:29.72,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,要挂你一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.26,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,世界要完蛋了吗 笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:32.61,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,像个男孩子一样 好讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.19,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,像个男孩子一样 好喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.91,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,主播好拼命笑死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:37.40,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,成功了就关注你的频道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:38.58,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,赌一亿失败
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:39.66,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,You are so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:40.99,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,真赌上地球的命运了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:42.24,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,以前这人踹过我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.46,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,这游戏好像很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:44.99,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,让她一个人肩负这些不太对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:46.71,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,这个整人企划要什么时候结束啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:49.62,DefaultTop,Announcer,0,0,0,,全世界的人啊 见证吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:51.44,DefaultTop,Announcer,0,0,0,,这是何等的坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:55.77,DefaultTop,Announcer,0,0,0,,黒廼灵子正为了我们人类战斗着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:07:00.65,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,成功了 我穿过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.53,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:06.42,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,搞成这样不就只是单纯的垃圾游戏了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:09.78,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,到达这里的是灵子小姐真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:15.04,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,不对 应该说这是被宇宙级的概率所确定下来的命运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:20.14,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,就算你这么说 如果我在这里输掉就全白费了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.38,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:34.48,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,游戏平衡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.03,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,毕竟是最终关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:38.34,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,肯定不会跟普通的关卡一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:43.40,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,面对杂兵群的灵子选手 要如何克服难关呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:47.40,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可恶 太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:56.91,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,别碍事啊 你们这群腥臭鱼头混账
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:06.76,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这可是现代不被允许的 达到了歧视程度的外貌主义
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:08.89,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,灵子选手 这要扣分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:11.45,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这事和游戏有任何关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:14.51,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,现在可是连邪神都不得不低头的麻烦时代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:16.57,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,歧视言论
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:17.64,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,种族主义者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:19.13,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,印斯茅斯人好可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:21.27,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,不 那可是人类的敌人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:24.71,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,看来人类那边的麻烦还要更多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:25.92,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:30.99,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那么灵子选手 剩下的时间是十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:44.17,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,在这里浪费时间也不是办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:48.38,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,他们不可能设计成通过不了的关卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:49.95,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,毕竟这是个游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:53.51,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那家伙生前也是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.22,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我还没死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:06.48,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,不能停下 被恐惧追上的话就等于死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:08.45,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,必须全神贯注
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:12.66,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那群家伙绝对无法饶恕对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.24,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,黒廼灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.34,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:20.65,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:21.98,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:25.15,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这个是会消失的地板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:27.46,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,不是在体验版见识过了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:32.86,Default,Mama,0,0,0,,灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:34.67,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:36.18,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,真是太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:48.98,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,是我们的家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.36,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.53,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,你不开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:54.78,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,肯定开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:57.97,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,毕竟终于能只靠我们自己生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:09:59.61,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.61,0:10:04.44,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,在说这句话之前还得好好考虑一下租金和工作的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:06.40,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:09.30,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,有自己的家了就是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.30,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,说得是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:17.26,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,必须要回到我们的家去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:28.44,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:34.19,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,这下到底要怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:36.74,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,黒廼灵子 好像是出局了的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:41.38,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,灵子那家伙 竟然敢输掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:43.94,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:46.92,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,世界真的要完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.04,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,小哥你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:53.52,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,祂们 要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.46,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,邪神们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:09.31,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可恶 怎么可能就这么掉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:15.90,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那就是那群家伙说的演算装置吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:17.24,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:20.45,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但我得怎么爬上去？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:21.84,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,灵子…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.66,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,找找口袋里看看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:28.72,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这不是我的手机…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:32.59,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,灵子 或者神奈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:34.65,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:37.05,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,是我 天丛圭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:39.84,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐？ 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:46.33,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,你俩不管是谁 听到这个就说明我已经不在世上了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:49.35,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:52.81,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,因此我留下了最后的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:57.02,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,被称为阿撒托斯的邪神演算装置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:12:00.32,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,说到底是以Megalox社的服务器为基础构建的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:04.22,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,所以我通过只有开发者能使用的内部代码
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:07.68,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,故意利用bug创造了安全漏洞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:16.05,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,这段危机回避代码只能在很短暂的时间内生效
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:19.11,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,在被祂们发现之前赶紧逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:22.39,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,然后 请一定要赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:27.31,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,我知道这无法赎清我的罪行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:30.61,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,请务必…务必…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:34.16,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:42.85,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐已经直面了这悲伤的事件 堂堂正正地战斗过了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:44.53,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我真的觉得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:49.00,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,如果有人想要谴责你的话 我会揍扁他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.50,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,所以 接下来就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.06,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:58.08,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,别过来 会掉下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:00.88,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,去！ 去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:10.87,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,糟了 那玩意是最糟的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:12.14,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,不能被追到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.69,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可恶可恶可恶可恶可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:21.00,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,从我出生以来 人生中充满的都是各种痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:24.62,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,从来没发生过一件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:31.39,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但我一直努力着 忍受着 和舞由一起活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:35.07,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这就好…明明只要这样就足够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:39.80,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,难道连如此微小的愿望 这个世界都不能容许吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:43.76,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,无论谁都把我们当作掌心的玩物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.47,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我要报复你们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:47.30,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,让你们后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:51.27,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,让你们认同！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:55.73,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,真是的 结束以后回头看看还真是有点太扫兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:01.00,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,黒廼灵子小姐 失去她可真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.65,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,我还挺喜欢她的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:08.04,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,{\an1}那么各位 做好撤离的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:11.29,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:12.68,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:20.04,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.40,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,黒廼灵子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:27.20,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这 这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:32.32,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,居然有人类能逃出阿撒托斯 这在宇宙的历史中都是头一回
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:33.23,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,谁管你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:36.19,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,什么宇宙啊历史啊我才不管
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:39.44,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,不要用你们擅自定下的标准来评判我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.98,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,所以呢 你去哪了 克苏鲁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:46.66,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真亏你能到达这里 灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:48.76,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,克苏鲁 你在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:51.81,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,话说在前面 我现在正怒火中烧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:54.39,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,完全不觉得自己会输
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.91,0:14:56.83,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,呜哇 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:57.77,Default,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:58.65,Default,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.65,0:14:59.60,Default,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,表情好吓人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:00.54,Default,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,灵子加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.00,Default,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:09.93,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,所以说 赶紧现身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.64,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,很好很好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:14.19,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这才是值得余正眼相待之人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.11,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,世界的终结就得这样才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:21.64,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那么灵子 尽情地与我互相残杀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:32.74,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:35.39,Default,Commentator,0,0,0,,这是所谓的「第二形态」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.96,Default,Commentator,0,0,0,,游戏里的最终Boss常有这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:44.17,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,在游戏的最后总得有个Boss角色 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:47.94,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,哪有会因为这种理由就变得那么大的 笨蛋吗你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:50.01,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,骂谁笨呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:53.47,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那么 游戏开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.22,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,真卑鄙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:15:59.23,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,还剩五分钟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:07.65,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:12.16,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,灵子选手虽然预料之外地生还 但还是要到此为止了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:15.79,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,要是生在别的时代 她明明是个可能成神的人才
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.29,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,叽里咕噜地烦死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:25.44,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,大脑…好像快要沸腾了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:28.11,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但是要思考 思考下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:30.86,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那群家伙既然声称这是游戏 也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:36.52,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,是那里吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:42.69,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但要怎么才能破坏它？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:46.65,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这样吗——
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:56.62,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我在这里 章鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:58.95,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,你不会觉得这样就能藏起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.39,0:17:03.74,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,不在…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:04.59,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,手机？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:07.28,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,笨蛋！ 上当了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:08.51,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,混蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:13.43,Default,Cthulhu,400,0,0,,可恶的下等生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.43,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,但是这好吗？你可要没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.11,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,愉悦 真是愉悦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.11,0:17:25.29,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真想和你这样一直玩下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:27.02,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,敬谢不敏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:30.82,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,但游戏一定会迎来结束
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.49,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那么 阿撒托斯大人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.61,0:17:38.33,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,蠢货 打算把余也一起丢下去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:39.41,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这个就…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:41.62,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,毕竟这是游戏嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:46.16,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,玩乐时间结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:56.79,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,王手！ 立直！ 将军！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:57.79,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:18:00.62,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余会万分珍惜地拧碎你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:03.01,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,你尽管以此为荣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:07.77,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,但是为什么…内心感受到了悲伤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:11.42,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这具身体原主的情绪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:15.99,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,别用那张脸…用舞由的脸这么说话！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:18.19,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,粘液章鱼女
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:20.45,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,你说什么？ 碾碎你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:26.17,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:30.00,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.17,0:18:35.43,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,舞由！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:45.30,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,无论用什么手段 我都要打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:47.93,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,一起坠入地狱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:19:03.75,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你还要回家的吧 灵子——
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:04.58,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,神奈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:14.58,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:18.80,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,伟大的克苏鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:33.28,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:36.40,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,恭喜你 黒廼灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:41.84,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,不 这里就满怀敬意称你为死灵子小姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:47.92,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那么 本届大会就到此结束
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:54.81,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,按照约定 我们会就此陷入沉睡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:56.47,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:19:59.22,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.13,0:20:03.57,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,啊 是关于你的胜利点数的事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:06.53,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,请安心 我们会给你特别优惠！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:09.48,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,舞梦坂舞由的身体会还给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:12.41,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,虽然克苏鲁阁下可能会稍微闹点别扭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:15.78,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,但念及你这次的活跃表现 这也是应该的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.09,0:20:19.90,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,怎么了？ 身体有什么不舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:23.58,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我本来以为只要能把舞由夺回来 其他人都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:24.49,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:26.95,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但是…但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.69,0:20:30.08,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,圭姐相信了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:33.88,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,神奈也把一切都托付给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:40.78,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,事到如今 我怎么可能再背叛她们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:43.44,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,嘀嗒人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.25,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,和我决胜负吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:47.47,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,胜负？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.47,0:20:50.33,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,没错 你也是邪神吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:52.03,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那么就还有一战
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.03,0:20:56.96,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,如果我赢了 你就把邪神游戏中受过伤的人全都复原
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:21:01.15,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,你是说想让一切回到从未发生之前吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:02.36,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:05.79,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,像你们这样荒唐的家伙本来就不该存在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:08.83,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这种说法只是你们人类的自以为是罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:10.28,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:11.96,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,不过也行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:16.91,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,但是这个愿望 以灵子小姐你的点数可远远不够啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:18.38,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那你想怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:21.72,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,贷款 你觉得如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.43,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,贷款？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.93,0:21:27.08,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,现在开始进行特别追加游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:29.39,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,灵子要赌上的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:32.85,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,全人类的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:37.04,DefaultTop,Announcer,0,0,0,,灵灵灵子小姐你到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:39.07,DefaultTop,Commentator,0,0,0,,驳回啊！ 驳回！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.35,0:21:42.74,Default,Mama,0,0,0,,灵子…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:44.03,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:45.56,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,别把我们卷进来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:46.65,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,灵子去死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:48.71,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,去死 去死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.58,0:21:52.44,DefaultTop,Anchorwoman,0,0,0,,我…我不想死…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:55.26,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:22:01.04,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你们一直都置身事外 旁观取乐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.47,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但从最开始所有人就已经是当事人了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.47,0:22:06.05,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,从一开始所有人就已经被卷进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:09.95,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,还说什么感动 都是自说自话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.95,0:22:13.29,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,既然这样 我也要随心所欲地干
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:16.45,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,来吧 这是最后的游戏了！
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
